Spoilers!


What to wish for early in the game?  Here's my generic wish list.  I work
my priorities from top to bottom, for as many wishes as I am fortunate
enough to get:

1) 3 blessed scrolls of charging
2) blessed ring of teleport control
3) blessed luckstone
   (for spells; if you can't be smart, get lucky)
4) a blessed rustproof +2 long sword named Frost Brand
   Notes: only certain hacked versions support wishing for rustproof items;
              if you can't get it rustproof, rustproof it ASAP
          get it to rustproof +5 enchantment by any means necessary, then
              wield it while reading a blessed scroll of enchant weapon
          I haven't found level draining to be a significant problem
          If I already have Stormy or Excalibur, I don't wish for Frost Brand
5) a blessed magic marker (more cost effective than wishing for scrolls)
6) armor to fill missing intrinsics
   * magic resistance
	blessed +3 cloak of magic resistance
	blessed +3 gray dragon scale mail
   * disintegration resistance
	blessed +3 black dragon scale mail
   * double speed
	blessed rustproof +3 speed boots
   * extra dexterity (gauntlets of dexterity)
	blessed +3 gauntlets of dexterity
   * super telepathy 
	blessed rustproof +3 helm of telepathy
   * displacement
	blessed +3 cloak of displacement
   * reflection
	blessed +3 shield of reflection

		--Bill


